5. skills/first-principles/references/explore-unknowns/
--------------------------------------------------------
This module's "four-quadrant inventory" method comes from Thariq Shihipar's
article, "A Field Guide to Fable: Finding Your Unknowns." The method is his;
the credit is his.

    Source: https://x.com/trq212

One clarification: I couldn't determine who originally wrote the file I had on
my computer, or under what license (there's no public skill project under that
author's name, and I couldn't find matching content anywhere). So I rewrote, in
my own words, the parts of the opening that were too close to the original
phrasing, and I credit the source method directly at the top of the file. Ideas
themselves aren't protected by copyright — specific wording is — so the approach
here was: keep the idea, change the sentences, credit the source.

If Thariq feels this still isn't right, I'll adjust it or take it down, on his
say-so.


